{
  "title": "Luxuriantly Broiled Slovakian Crustaceans Skewers",
  "description": "Indulge in the rich flavors of Slovakia with these succulent crustacean skewers, carefully broiled to perfection and served on a wooden board. This dairy-free dish is sure to delight your taste buds.",
