      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the broiler to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the shrimp, scallops, mushrooms, onion, and bell pepper onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the skewers, making sure they are fully coated.",
    "Place the skewers on a wooden board and broil for 8-10 minutes, flipping halfway through.",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and let them cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with fresh parsley if desired."
